  "summary": "以武贪丑命比较己、癸年生人：己年武曲化禄、贪狼化权入命而制煞为用，己丑较其他己年更吉；癸年贪狼化忌与擎羊同踞，癸丑较其他癸年更凶。命宫与出生太岁宫重合是吉凶加重，并非四库生年一律吉。作者重申火星与贪狼同宫才符所论火贪条件。盘七残句及混排不用于推断，盘五说明「武食」疑字保留。",
  "summary_en": "Two Chou Life Palace examples compare Ji-year and Gui-year births with Military Melody and Greedy Wolf. In Ji years, Military Melody has Prosperity and Greedy Wolf Authority Transformation in Life; the strengthened palace harnesses malefics. Ji Chou is more favorable than other Ji years. In Gui years, Greedy Wolf has Obstruction Transformation and shares the placement with Ram Blade; Gui Chou is worse than other Gui years. Coincidence with the birth-year Tai Sui palace amplifies existing good or bad conditions, not universal good fortune for Storehouse-year births. The author specifies Fire Star with Greedy Wolf in the same palace. An unfinished Chart Seven condition and OCR-mixed diagram are excluded; Chart Five’s Wu Shi wording remains uncertain.",
